<main class="rb-page">
  <header class="rb-page-head">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Interactive product tour</p><h1>See the full deal from both sides.</h1></div>
    <p>No account, no setup, no empty dashboard. Choose a perspective and walk through a realistic export quotation flow.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="rb-demo-choice">
    <%= link_to demo_path, class: "rb-demo-card" do %>
      <span class="rb-demo-number">01 · SELLER WORKSPACE</span>
      <h2>Run the deal.</h2>
      <p>Review an inquiry, create a quotation, track revisions and buyer activity, then turn acceptance into a proforma invoice.</p>
      <span class="rb-demo-arrow">↗</span>
    <% end %>
    <%= link_to buyer_demo_path, class: "rb-demo-card" do %>
      <span class="rb-demo-number">02 · BUYER ROOM</span>
      <h2>Make the decision.</h2>
      <p>Review products and commercial terms, ask a question, request a change, and accept the exact revision.</p>
      <span class="rb-demo-arrow">↗</span>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</main>
